    (v_topic_id, 'Progesterone typically causes basal body temperature to:', '["Fall", "Rise slightly", "Stay unchanged always", "Become lower than ambient temperature", "Drop sharply before ovulation"]', 1, '0.5 degree F rise marks the start of the luteal phase.', 32),
